  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Economic Crimes -Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the AML/CFT regime of Paraguay by working with the FIU and other stakeholders to develop and strengthen (a) the operational effectiveness of the FIU so that it can operate in full compliance with international standards and best practices, and continue to serve as a core agency of Paraguays AML/CFT regime; (b) the capability of Paraguayan authorities to investigate and prosecute money laundering crimes; (c) the ability of Paraguayan authorities to seize, manage, and forfeit assets; and (d) improve the AML/CFT supervision of the financial and non-financial sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
